{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","冰冻之墓"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","얼어붙은 무덤"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标造成伤害和冻结，并制造极寒领域施加霜冻。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","목표에게 대미지를 입히고 빙결 효과를 부여하며, 극한 영역을 생성 후 서리 효과를 부여한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","短暂蓄力后，选择一名敌人，对其造成240% + 20% ATK伤害，并冻结目标6秒。并在目标及其周围2格范围内制造极寒领域，领域内的敌人每2秒会被施加一次“霜冻”状态。优先选择周围2格敌人数量最多的敌人作为目标。每层“霜冻”会使其降低15急速，持续6秒，至多叠加3层。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","짧은 시간 차징 후 적 1명을 선택하여 240% + 20% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 목표를 6초간 빙결시킨다. 또한 목표 및 그 주변 2칸 범위 내에 극한 영역을 생성하여 영역 내의 적에게 2초마다 서리 효과를 부여한다. 적군 수가 가장 많은 주변 2칸을 선택하여 우선 목표로 삼는다. 서리 중첩당 6초간 급속을 15 감소시킨다(최대 3스택 중첩 가능)."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":26,"end":32,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":35,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"keyword:freeze"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":22,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":56,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"keyword:freeze"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 260% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","冻结时间延长至8秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","빙결 시간이 8초로 연장된다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":0,"end":2,"tooltip_key":"keyword:freeze"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":0,"end":2,"tooltip_key":"keyword:freeze"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 270% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 280% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","冰霜新星"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","프로스트 노바"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标造成一次小范围的伤害并施加霜冻。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","목표에게 작은 범위 내에 대미지를 1회 입히고 서리 효과를 부여한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对目标及其周围1格范围内的敌人造成一次155% + 15% ATK伤害，并施加一层“霜冻”。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","목표 및 그 주변 1칸 범위 내의 적에게 155% + 15% ATK의 대미지를 1회 입히며, 서리 효과를 1스택 부여한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至165% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 165% + 15% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至175% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 175% + 15% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至185% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 185% + 15% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","妖术雪球"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","매직 스노우볼"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","总是会召唤雪球围绕自身，敌人被控制时，雪球会自动攻击造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","언제나 스노우볼을 소환하여 자신을 감싼다. 적이 제어 상태에 있으면 스노우볼이 자동으로 공격하여 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","制造4个雪球围绕自身，每过3秒自动发射一枚雪球攻击目标。另外，当有敌人处于控制状态下，雪球会自动攻击该目标造成130% + 10% ATK伤害，每个敌人受到雪球的攻击有2.5秒间隔。当雪球全部使用后，卡列琳娜会再次制造雪球。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","스노우볼을 4개 만들어 자신을 감싸며, 3초마다 스노우볼을 1개씩 자동 발사하여 목표를 공격한다. 또한, 제어 상태의 적이 있으면 스노우볼이 자동으로 해당 목표를 공격하여 130% + 10% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다. 적은 스노우볼 공격을 2.5초 간격으로 받으며, 스노우볼을 전부 사용한 후 캐롤라이나는 스노우볼을 다시 만든다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":59,"end":65,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":100,"end":106,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":96,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至140% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 140% + 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至150% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 150% + 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每个敌人受到雪球攻击最短间隔缩短至1.5秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","적이 스노우볼 공격을 받는 가장 짧은 간격이 1.5초로 단축된다."],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/kr","영웅 마스터리"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身暴击，当使用多次“妖术雪球”后进一步提升暴击。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신의 치명타가 증가한다. 매직 스노우볼을 여러 번 사용하면 치명타가 한층 더 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高14点暴击，且当使用5次“妖术雪球”后，额外提升18点暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 치명타가 14 증가하며, 매직 스노우볼 5회 사용 시 치명타가 추가로 18 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高19点暴击，且当使用5次“妖术雪球”后，额外提升24点暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 치명타가 19 증가하며, 매직 스노우볼 5회 사용 시 치명타가 추가로 24 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高24点暴击，且当使用5次“妖术雪球”后，额外提升30点暴击。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 치명타가 24 증가하며, 매직 스노우볼 5회 사용 시 치명타가 추가로 30 증가한다."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","冰寒漩涡"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/kr","얼음 소용돌이"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","妖术雪球会造成更高伤害，可造成范围伤害并降低魔法抗性。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/kr","매직 스노우볼은 높은 대미지를 입히며, 광역 대미지를 생성하고 마법 방어력을 감소시킨다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜每次使用“妖术雪球”，会永久提升雪球10%伤害，至多提升7次。从第三次使用“妖术雪球”开始，新雪球会造成1格范围的范围伤害并额外降低敌人15%的魔抗，持续6秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","캐롤라이나가 매직 스노우볼을 사용할 때마다 스노우볼의 대미지가 10% 영구 증가하며 최대 7회 증가한다. 세 번째 매직 스노우볼부터 새로운 스노우볼은 1칸 범위의 광역 대미지를 입히고, 적의 마법 방어력을 15% 추가 감소시키며 6초간 지속된다."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","卡列琳娜的普通攻击攻击被控制的敌人时，使1枚雪球攻击该敌人。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","캐롤라이나의 일반 공격으로 제어 상태의 적을 공격하면 스노우볼 1개가 적에게 발사된다."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","降低魔抗的效果提升至25%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","마법 방어력 감소 효과가 25%로 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","降低魔抗的效果提升至30%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","마법 방어력 감소 효과가 30%로 증가한다."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/kr","각성의 힘"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“妖术雪球”造成伤害时也会施加“霜冻”。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/kr","매직 스노우볼로 대미지를 입힐 때에도 서리를 부여한다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“妖术雪球”的雪球造成伤害时也会施加“霜冻”。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","매직 스노우볼의 스노우볼이 대미지를 입힐 때에도 서리를 부여한다."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","拉季诺夫家族烛台"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/kr","라지노프 가문의 촛대"]]}